       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum of 2,550 mg/day (2,000 mg/day for extended-release). Doses that high raise the risk of serious GI toxicity and lactic acidosis.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals.** This is 2,550 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **1700 mg total per day.** For example, 850 mg PO twice daily with meals.\n- **Another dose.** For example, 500 mg or 1000 mg per administration.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do want 1700 mg three times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose."
